.git
**/node_modules
**/.next/cache
**/dist
**/build
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.venv
**/*.tgz

# yalc-linked packages (e.g. @odigos/vmagent-api-apollo-client) ship their prebuilt
# dist/ and are consumed via file:.yalc/* in package.json. The broad ignores above
# (notably **/dist and **/node_modules) would strip that output from the build
# context, so re-include the whole .yalc tree.
!.yalc/**